# Never bake local config/secrets into images
src/DocQuery.Api/appsettings.json

# Build artifacts and caches
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/

# Not needed in any image
.git/
.claude/
.vscode/
docs/
# ...except the curated demo corpus, allow-listed file by file so nothing
# (like the interview bank) rides into an image by accident:
!docs/samples/certifications.md
!docs/samples/interview-qa.md
!docs/samples/open-source-contributions.md
!docs/samples/project-docquery.md
!docs/samples/resume.md
tests/
Demo.mov
SETUP-LOG.md
start.sh
*.md
